{"4513480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scarlet Skips", "steam_appid": 4513480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Help Scarlet break out of her funk by helping her touch grass! <br>Life can be hard, <i>really</i> hard, but like Scarlet, you can take it one jump at a time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513480/extras/669301d01e5636686e20363a7624c1a2.avif?t=1788038880\" width=1560 height=351 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is key! Scarlet Skips is played entirely with press, hold, and release inputs of a single button!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy for anyone to pick up and play! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly impossible to put down! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513480/extras/62901ad1a31aca1d458f6cbeab27ea95.avif?t=1788038880\" width=1560 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and choose from 3 random power-ups in a completely original Rogue-Like upgrade system...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 upgrade cards; Increase your jump height, add a jump-rope, set it on FIRE?!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513480/extras/e7f1541c86002088e1be3f80918665b6.avif?t=1788038880\" width=1560 height=351 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades can be stacked and combined into a virtually infinite number of configurations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your favorite builds and optimize for the perfect run! Or try your best with self-imposed limitations!  <br>You do you!  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513480/extras/a952af335b18d5b384433ae5b487a05b.avif?t=1788038880\" width=1560 height=351 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We worked hard to push Scarlet's animation system to be as dynamic, expressive, and adorable as possible!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using fancy Unreal Engine animation tools, Scarlet's movement is achieved by combining dozens of candid animations with logic-driven procedural movement, allowing her to respond dynamically to gameplay conditions!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Help Scarlet break out of her funk by helping her touch grass! <br>Life can be hard, <i>really</i> hard, but like Scarlet, you can take it one jump at a time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513480/extras/669301d01e5636686e20363a7624c1a2.avif?t=1788038880\" width=1560 height=351 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is key! Scarlet Skips is played entirely with press, hold, and release inputs of a single button!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy for anyone to pick up and play! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly impossible to put down! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513480/extras/62901ad1a31aca1d458f6cbeab27ea95.avif?t=1788038880\" width=1560 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and choose from 3 random power-ups in a completely original Rogue-Like upgrade system...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 upgrade cards; 